B.arf=new A.a(B.b,["SCA/ICP: ataque 300\u2013600 mg VO dose \xfanica \u2192 manuten\xe7\xe3o 75 mg/dia | AVCi/AIT: 75 mg/dia (ou ataque 300 mg) | DAP: 75 mg/dia | Dupla antiagrega\xe7\xe3o (DAPT) p\xf3s-stent: 75 mg + AAS \xd7 12 meses","SCA/ICP: carga 300\u2013600 mg VO dosis \xfanica \u2192 mantenimiento 75 mg/d\xeda | AVCi/AIT: 75 mg/d\xeda (o carga 300 mg) | DAP: 75 mg/d\xeda | Doble antiagregaci\xf3n (DAPT) post-stent: 75 mg + AAS \xd7 12 meses"],t.w)
